        "type": "text",
        "content": "~300"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "FRAMES PER LOG"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "\u25b8  7 ring cameras give full 360\u00b0 horizontal coverage \u00b7 20 Hz \u00b7 ~300 frames per log.\n\u25b8  3D box annotations + LiDAR + per-camera capture timestamps for every frame.\nWaymo offers two sets, each missing half: Perception = 5 cameras ~250\u00b0 forward (rear gap) with LiDAR + 3D boxes; End-to-End = 8 cameras full ring, but 10 Hz, 972-px, 1\u20132\u00b0 overlap, rolling shutter, camera-only release. Only AV2 combines full ring + LiDAR + boxes + per-camera timestamps; Waymo migration stays queued as our generalization gate."
      }
    ],
