      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "METHOD"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Method: remove the cause \u2014 three fixes"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "\u2460  Virtual centre  \u2014  project from the cameras' own centroid instead of the ego origin, using standard multi-view geometry (intrinsics/extrinsics ray casting) with per-pixel depth from accumulated LiDAR sweeps \u2192 projection residuals drop 18\u201396\u00d7 and the seams come into alignment."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "\u2461  EMC per-camera shutter poses  \u2014per-camera shutter poses \u2014 the seven cameras fire up to \u00b122.5 ms apart, so each image is projected with the ego pose of its own exposure instant, obtained by SE(3) pose interpolation (quaternion SLERP + linear translation) \u2192 the static world aligns exactly."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "\u2462  One body \u00b7 one camera \u00b7 one time (+OMC)  \u2014 every moving object is rendered whole from a single camera at a single instant: YOLOv8 instance masks give the outline, the 3D boxes carry its identity across cameras (IoU association), the residual shutter shift is measured by ECC registration and compensated, and the patch is blended back through view morphing plus a minimum-error DP seam \u2192 ghosted / seam-cut cars impossible by construction."
      }
    ],
