      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "COMPLETING THE SPHERE"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Outpainting the missing sphere: ground + sky"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "GROUND  \u2014 real pixels, no generation"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "INPUT  scene-band panorama + the log's other frames (ego moved).\nMethod  temporal reprojection \u2014 the road under the car now was photographed seconds earlier / later; reproject those real pixels (occlusion-checked).\nOUTPUT  nadir filled with 94.5\u2013100% real pixels, lane lines continuous, ego hood removed."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "SKY  \u2014 the only generated layer"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "INPUT  panorama + sky mask (the only evidence-free region).\nMethod  FLUX.1-Fill diffusion inpainting + DiT360 panorama LoRA, auto-prompt from the visible sky band (5/5 scenes correct).\nOUTPUT  complete sphere \u2014 every pixel outside the mask byte-identical to input."
      }
    ],
